# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if you intend to have development environments with different versions of python, you may want to ignore Pipfile.lock.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Using Poetry, it is generally recommended to include poetry.lock in version control.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Using pdm, it is generally recommended to include pdm.lock in version control.
#pdm.lock

